{"id":860027,"title":"02｜如何最大程度发挥DeepSeek R1的优势？","content":"DeepSeek R1在数学、代码和自然语言推理方面表现出色，通过强化学习生成自动思维链，提供复杂问题的解释性。与非推理模型V3相比，R1在深度思考后给出更具体、结构化的解决方案，但耗时较长。R1具备思维链可解释性、结构化推理能力和动态推理能力，尤其在处理陌生领域问题时优势明显。例如，在物流成本优化中，R1不仅诊断问题原因，还提供详细方案和风险控制建议。此外，R1能够进行多维度分析，如评估新能源电池制造企业的贷款申请，展示财务健康度等关键指标。对于简单任务，可以使用蒸馏版本的小模型，这些小模型生成速度快且能满足日常需求。蒸馏过程将大模型的知识迁移到小模型，使其在特定场景下表现优异。总结来说，R1适合需要高度解释性和分步骤执行的任务，而资源受限时可选择蒸馏小模型以降低成本。","comments":[{"had_liked":false,"id":399684,"user_name":"lizchan","can_delete":false,"product_type":"c3","uid":2031114,"ip_address":"上海","ucode":"056E939BD62D44","user_header":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/1e/fe/0a/791d0f5e.jpg","comment_is_top":false,"comment_ctime":1744966527,"is_pvip":false,"replies":null,"discussion_count":1,"race_medal":0,"score":2,"product_id":101000501,"comment_content":"课件链接可否贴下，后续回顾更便捷。","like_count":0,"discussions":[{"author":{"id":2017420,"avatar":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/1e/c8/8c/e81c8f83.jpg","nickname":"王智鹏 Zac","note":"","ucode":"FD7504640C833A","race_medal":0,"user_type":8,"is_pvip":false},"reply_author":{"id":0,"avatar":"","nickname":"","note":"","ucode":"","race_medal":0,"user_type":1,"is_pvip":false},"discussion":{"id":660234,"discussion_content":"课件下载链接：https://pan.baidu.com/s/1VQFQ_kC9xz85JLlgUHIJOA （提取码: hs88）","content_length":66,"likes_number":0,"is_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"ctime":1745911935,"is_liked":false,"can_delete":false,"is_complain":false,"is_top":false,"parent_id":0,"ip_address":"北京","group_id":0,"attachments":[]},"score":2,"extra":"","child_discussion_number":0,"child_discussions":[]}]},{"had_liked":false,"id":398753,"user_name":"非净额结算","can_delete":false,"product_type":"c3","uid":1326856,"ip_address":"浙江","ucode":"F4A3639AB978D8","user_header":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/14/3f/08/791d0f5e.jpg","comment_is_top":false,"comment_ctime":1742128768,"is_pvip":false,"replies":null,"discussion_count":1,"race_medal":0,"score":2,"product_id":101000501,"comme